Bard AA

Activate-able Passive Ability.

Costs: 3/0/3/0/3/0/3/0/3/0

Enabling and Disabling the ability each time you buy it. Effective cost at 10 of 10 level is 15AAs.


 <nowiki>
This passive ability allows five Bard songs to auto pulse. (permanently)

In order for a song to be eligible, it must have no mana cost, have no cooldown, and be a non-targeted area of effect song.
Any song that meets these criter(i)a cannot be played manually while the ability is turned on.
This ability chooses the first eligible song, starting from the final spell gem, and working backwards.

Requirements: Level 1, No previous ability requirements.
 </nowiki>

Effectively, starting at the bottom spell gem, and working towards spell gem #1 it will pulse each song in order up to 5, and repeat. /melody on permanent uninterruptible repeat.